   670	// Design and prior art: dlpack_operand.h, RetainUntilComplete. Every function here runs on the calling host thread with
   671	// the GIL held (every _tc_signal entry point is a pybind11 function that keeps the GIL), so the pending list needs no
   672	// lock. Deleters may run Python (a ctypes producer) and may even re-enter tc_signal; therefore an entry is always taken
