   375	// allocation itself before a P1-T path acts on it (the DLPack export publishes it and fences its stream; fill_ launches
   376	// on it): cudaPointerGetAttributes of element 0 must report a CUDA allocation on a.device.index. Returns "" when it
   377	// does; otherwise a message naming both devices (the caller raises its own error type). A failed query raises
   378	// RuntimeError (its slot entry consumed). Empty arrays have no memory to act on and pass. The query does not
