   518	// extent of 2^40 + 1 fp32 elements (4 TiB + 4 bytes of metadata; shape and byte bounds fit int64) the block count
   519	// 2^32 + 1 became 1: one block wrote 256 elements, the launch succeeded and the revision was bumped (review probes
